<title>USA: TABLE-Ducommun Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Ducommun Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Income Statement</p>
<p>		     Three Months Ended	  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>		     6/28/97     6/29/96     6/28/97	6/29/96</p>
<p> Net Sales   $39,384,000 $28,869,000  $74,689,000 $52,661,000</p>
